                                                   "shipping_returns":  "\u003ch3\u003eSHIPPING\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe currently ship across India.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrders are carefully inspected and securely packed before dispatch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree shipping is available on eligible orders as per the offer displayed on our website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor orders below the free-shipping threshold, the applicable shipping charge will be shown at checkout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrders are generally processed within 1–2 business days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEstimated delivery time is typically 3–7 business days after dispatch, depending on delivery location and courier serviceability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTracking details will be shared once your order has been dispatched.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIMPORTANT UNBOXING VIDEO\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor your protection and ours, please record a clear, continuous, unedited video while opening the shipment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe video should begin before the outer courier package is opened and clearly show:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eShipping label\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSealed outer package\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eComplete unboxing process\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eJewellery received\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAny damage, missing item or incorrect product\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eClaims for damaged, missing or incorrect products should be supported by a clear continuous unboxing video.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRETURNS \u0026amp; EXCHANGE\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf there is an issue with your order, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReturns/exchanges may be accepted for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eIncorrect product received\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eProduct received damaged\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eManufacturing defect\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEligible size/variant exchange, where applicable\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo request assistance, provide:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eOrder number\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eClear product photos\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eContinuous unboxing video for damaged/missing/incorrect-item claims\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eReason for return/exchange\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRETURN CONDITIONS\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe product must:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBe unused and unworn\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBe in original condition\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHave tags/seals intact where supplied\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eInclude original box/pouch/accessories\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eShow no scratches, alteration, perfume/chemical exposure or signs of use\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eReturned items will be quality checked before refund/exchange approval.\u003c/p\u003e"
